---
title: "repay (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate_market + ensure_version_matches
    q_validate --> q_check_circuit: assert !circuit_break_triggered
    q_check_circuit --> q_check_amount: assert coin.value != 0
    q_check_amount --> q_load_config: load min_borrow_amount from asset_config
    q_load_config --> q_accrue: accrue_interest(reserve, now)
    q_accrue --> q_check_obligation: assert obligation.market_id matches
    q_check_obligation --> q_snapshot_old: old_borrow = obligation.debt.unsafe_debt_amount
    q_snapshot_old --> q_repay_debt: obligation.repay_debt(coin.value, borrow_index)
    q_repay_debt --> q_check_min: enforce_post_borrow_repay_invariant(min_borrow)
    q_check_min --> q_calc_residual: residual = if debt_ceil lte amount then amount - debt_ceil else 0
    q_calc_residual --> q_split_refund: refund = coin.split(residual)
    q_split_refund --> q_update_emode: emode_group.update_asset_borrow(old, new)
    q_update_emode --> q_rate_limit: emode.borrow_limiter.reduce_outflow(now, repay_amount)
    q_rate_limit --> q_reserve_repay: reserve.repay_amount(coin)
    q_reserve_repay --> q_check_overpay: debt lt repay
    q_check_overpay --> q_donation: excess goes to cash_reserve (donation)
    q_check_overpay --> q_normal: debt = debt - repay_amount
    q_donation --> q_try_stop_adl: try_stop_borrow_deleverage
    q_normal --> q_try_stop_adl: try_stop_borrow_deleverage
    q_try_stop_adl --> q_update_mining: update_obligation_reward_manager(borrow_type)
    q_update_mining --> q_emit: emit RepayEvent
    q_emit --> q_return_refund: return refund coin
    q_return_refund --> [*]

    note right of q_repay_debt
        INV-001: If debt is fully repaid, debt entry is removed from obligation
        INV-002: If partial repay, remaining debt must be gte min_borrow_amount
        INV-003: Overpayment beyond debt ceiling treated as donation to cash_reserve
        INV-004: repay_on_behalf allows anyone to repay (no ownership check on obligation)
    end note
